{
  "kind": "tegara.e2.forwardTransportProfile.v2",
  "subject": "AN EXAMPLE, NOT A RUN TARGET: the shape of the separate early-stop profile of design section 7, for a run whose target epoch 0 is REFUSED by the kernel in generation 0 (a served header disagreeing with the plan) and which therefore stops by name after generation 0; only such a profile, naming the generation, the code and the epoch, may accept the generation prefix [0]",
